 * Uses repetition count, recency, and explicit user interest cues.
 * This replaces the stub with a real evidence-based scoring engine.
 *
 * @param {string} jsonlPath - path to conversationLogger's JSONL file
 * @param {object} [opts]
 * @param {number} [opts.maxLines=100] - how many recent lines to scan
 * @param {number} [opts.recencyHalfLifeMs=120000] - exponential decay half-life
 * @returns {Promise<Array<{topic:string, score:number}>>} sorted array of topic scores
