+/**
+ * Execute a Python tool via pythonWorker.execute() with retry and timeout.
+ * Retries once on transient errors (connection reset, timeout, process crash)
+ * with exponential backoff (500ms then 2s). Emits 'sandbox:tool_error' on failure.
+ * @param {string} toolName - the tool/command name
+ * @param {object} params - parameters for the tool
+ * @param {object} [options]
+ * @param {number} [options.timeout=15000] - max wait per attempt in ms
